    Object             : StoredProcedure SMigration.MetadataEntityTypeScope_List
    Source schema hash : B85C5EA5E5A852420BCE03B59A722F36A3412255472CEC325078084B8DC14C38
    Definition SHA-256 : 2A7D878AD88047A41552DF8CF73ABDD6C06F97F72032077624BE590B61CD7785

    This deterministic file was synchronized from an explicitly selected, validated and accepted
    CymBuild_Dev source-definition snapshot. Review and commit the source-control diff before using
    it for promotion.
